{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07637","headline":"古挽歌 · 孟云卿","name":"古挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草草闾巷喧，涂车俨成位。\n冥冥何所须，尽我生人意。\n北邙路非远，此别终天地。\n临穴频抚棺，至哀反无泪。\n尔形未衰老，尔息才童稚。\n骨肉安可离，皇天若容易。\n房帷即灵帐，庭宇爲哀次。\n薤露歌若斯，人生尽如寄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}